      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Renders Template-kun performing a motion, in eight directions.\n\nLoad Motion: 'sprute/...' are the bundled motions. Any animated GLB placed in ComfyUI's input folder is listed too, and gets retargeted onto Template-kun. For a GLB with several animations, type the animation's name, e.g. run.\n\nEvery Nth Frame: the video keeps every Nth frame, at 24 / N fps, and the motion's length snaps to a multiple of N frames so a loop wraps cleanly. Set Render Driving Video's snap_to_multiple to 0 to keep the motion's exact speed."
      ]
    },
